development.solution_text:
The top view is a square with four lines from its corners to the projected apex at the centre.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw (0,0) rectangle (3,3);
\draw (0,0)--(1.5,1.5)--(3,0);
\draw (0,3)--(1.5,1.5)--(3,3);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

